+constructs lazily. The binary reads it as written there, and a function so applied outside its
+domain declines, as in `prove-it-cli/tests/startup-levels`.
+
+A substitute the configuration gives a definition of another module (`G <- [Inner] f2`,
+`g <- [Lib] f2`) TLC sets on the body of that module's definition and evaluates that body each
